        <headline>Small Craft Advisory issued September 25 at 1:38AM EDT until September 25 at 5:00PM EDT by NWS Wilmington NC</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...North winds 15 to 25 kt with gusts up to 30 kt and seas
4 to 7 ft.

* WHERE...Northeast South Carolina coastal waters out 20 NM.

* WHEN...Until 5 PM EDT this afternoon.

* IMPACTS...Conditions will be hazardous to small craft.
</description>
        <instruction>Inexperienced mariners, especially those operating smaller
vessels, should avoid navigating in hazardous conditions.</instruction>
